  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>A slash to the inside of your thigh cuts the femoral artery, resulting in some truly spectacular arterial spurting.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Bleeding] (3). If you fail a <strong>Challenging (+0) Endurance</strong> Test you’re also unlucky enough to have had the artery severed high enough that an ordinary tourniquet is useless, in which case Surgery (and a long clamp) is necessary to remove the @Condition[Bleeding] Condition.</p>"
